+/// neighbours taking its room, so Lattice never pins one: the host takes a
+/// dock left empty away and draws its own empty center (lattice-gpui's
+/// shell, on `DockEvent::LayoutChanged`).
+const KEEP_LAST_PANEL: bool = false;
